Package: sdmTMBexperiments
Title: Experimental Helper Functions for 'sdmTMB'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Mikko", "Vihtakari", , "mikko.vihtakari@hi.no", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(affiliation = "Institute of Marine Research", ORCID = "0000-0003-0371-4319"))
Description: A collection of experimental helper functions for working
    with fitted spatiotemporal models from the 'sdmTMB' package: model
    comparison, mesh sensitivity analysis, retrospective analysis,
    survey-specific index comparison, prediction-grid construction, and
    diagnostic plotting. The package doubles as a showcase of how to use
    these functions and a staging ground for methods that may later be
    adopted into 'sdmTMB'.
